                        "string_id":  "lukash_sniper_reward_dialog_phrase_4",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "Well done! Now, let\u0027s take a peek... Hmm, he mentions some kind of Raven right before it all turns into chicken scratch. What\u0027s the story with that? He meets this guy and goes off the rails just after?",
                        "JA_current":  "Well done! Now, let\u0027s take a peek... Hmm, he mentions some kind of Raven right before it all turns into chicken scratch. What\u0027s the story with that? He meets this guy and goes off the rails just after?",
